00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:34.860
which I think works really well of like,

193
00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:37.166
where do you get your energy from?

194
00:08:37.166 --> 00:08:40.320
And a really easy way to think of it is,

195
00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.330
to imagine that you're at a party

196
00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.520
and you've been there for about two hours

