198
00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.810
and you're having a good time,

199
00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:51.030
but still, the extrovert at the party,

200
00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:56.030
their battery is charging up and now they want more,

201
00:08:56.070 --> 00:08:59.190
