202
00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:01.020
no matter how good a time they're having.

203
00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.870
And so there comes that moment where you just wish

204
00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:06.513
you could beam yourself home and be someplace else.

205
00:09:09.146 --> 00:09:11.246
And so it really is this question of like,

206
00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:17.100
how much stimulation do you need in order to feel

207
00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:19.440
