212
00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:30.480
Like if things are too quiet, not enough is happening,

213
00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:32.490
you feel like, I better call a friend,

214
00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:33.663
I better do something.

215
