237
00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:38.553
that predispose you in one direction or another,

238
00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:40.950
and then layered over the temperament,

239
00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.780
you have all kinds of life experiences

240
00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:45.513
and skills that you gain and it's all a big mishmash.

241
00:10:47.077 --> 00:10:49.990
But Dev there are babies who are born

242
00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:53.640
into this world and from the day they're born,

243
00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:55.560
you can test their nervous systems and see that

244
00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:58.170
they're more reactive to all different kinds of stimulation.

245
00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.990
Like they'll salivate more if you give them sugar water,

246
00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:02.220
and put it in their mouths.

247
00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.470
And so the babies who salivate more

248
00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.640
when they're two years old,

249
00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.560
and you put them into a playgroup of kids,

250
00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.120
they've never met before,

251
00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:11.270
those are the babies who are gonna tense up

252
00:11:12.975 --> 00:11:14.730
and take longer to integrate into the group

253
00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:17.310
because they basically have a nervous system

254
00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:20.070
that is just reacting more to new inputs,

255
00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:23.310
and it makes you wanna like slow things down and pause

256
00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:25.493
and check it all out right before you're ready.

257
00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:28.587
When I think about that,

258
00:11:28.587 --> 00:11:30.960
the word that comes to mind is sensitivity, right?

259
00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:33.720
Which is applicable to bitter sweetness too.

