1000
00:45:58.080 --> 00:46:00.840
for the experience of their sharing.

1001
00:46:00.840 --> 00:46:03.180
And so I've dedicated my career to tracking down

1002
00:46:03.180 --> 00:46:05.610
the most compelling profits on the planet,

1003
00:46:05.610 --> 00:46:08.700
going deep with each of them on my podcast,

1004
00:46:08.700 --> 00:46:11.550
to elucidate the best of what they have to offer,

